Libraries for StretchRes
=======================

This directory contains required third-party libraries, static libraries, 
dynamic libraries, and their necessary headers.

Libraries referenced:
- None: The StretchRes tweak does not link against any third-party static 
  or dynamic libraries. All functionality is implemented using:
  - iOS system frameworks (UIKit, Foundation, CoreGraphics)
  - Theos Substrate runtime (provided by the build environment)
  - Standard iOS APIs compatible with iOS 15.0–15.8.8

The tweak is designed to have zero external library dependencies beyond what 
is provided by iOS and Theos, ensuring maximum compatibility and minimal 
package size.

Files in this directory:
- (None - no third-party libraries required)
- Documentation of API usage instead